```java
@Entity
public class Product {                  // not final → proxyable
    @Id @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
    private Long id;
    private String name;

    protected Product() { }             // JPA uses this via reflection
    public Product(String name) { this.name = name; }
}
```
A `protected`/package-private no-arg constructor satisfies JPA while keeping it out of your public API.

