```java
@Entity
public class Product {
    @Id @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
    private Long id;
    private BigDecimal price;
    private BigDecimal taxRate;

    @Transient
    private BigDecimal priceWithTax;

    public BigDecimal getPriceWithTax() {
        if (priceWithTax == null && price != null && taxRate != null) {
            priceWithTax = price.multiply(BigDecimal.ONE.add(taxRate)); // derive on demand
        }
        return priceWithTax;
    }
}
```
Derived from persisted fields, so it's recomputed after every load — no duplicated data in the table.

