@Entity
public class Order {
    @Id @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
    private Long id;

    private LocalDate orderDate;     // → DATE, no @Temporal
    private LocalDateTime createdAt; // → TIMESTAMP
    private Instant processedAt;     // → UTC timestamp (best for distributed systems)
    private LocalTime deliveryWindow;// → TIME
}
```
Use `Instant` for global event times; `LocalDateTime` has no timezone, so it's wrong for cross-timezone systems.
